# Patterns here are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. A bare name like
# "icon.png" also matches "assets/icon.png", which silently dropped every image
# from a deployment once already.
#
# costam.apk is deliberately NOT listed. Since 2.1.0 it is ARM-only and fits
# under Vercel's 100 MB per-file limit, so it ships in the deployment and is
# served straight from /costam.apk. It is gitignored, so the deploy has to run
# from a working folder that has the file — a Git-integration deploy would ship
# the site without the download.

/.git
/.gitignore
/README.md
/COSTAM_SITE.md
/ICONS.md

# Unoptimised source renders kept at the project root.
# The copies the site actually serves live in assets/ and MUST ship.
/01-ingredients.png
/02-add.png
/03-recipe.png
/04-breakdown.png
/icon.png
/favicon.png
/icon-512.png
/adaptive-icon.png
/splash-icon.png
